OL,3,GNEWSATowers recommended for approval
OL,4,Adespite concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for two major towers overlooking
OL,7,Fone of Birmingham's best-known
OL,8,Fcanalside areas are recommended for
OL,9,Fapproval, despite concerns about their
OL,10,Fimpact on nearby heritage sites.
OL,12,FThe proposed residential buildings,
OL,13,Fstanding at 30 and 17 storeys, form
OL,14,Fpart of the wider Arena Central
OL,15,Fmasterplan, a mixed-use regeneration
OL,16,Fscheme in the city centre.
OL,18,FThe development, if approved, would
OL,19,Fdeliver 526 apartments, alongside
OL,20,Fretail and commercial space, communal
OL,21,Ffacilities for residents and landscaped
OL,22,Fpublic areas.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
