OL,3,GNEWSATowers recommended for approval
OL,4,Adespite concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FHeritage and waterways organisations
OL,7,Fhave expressed concerns over the
OL,8,Fproposals, with the Canal and River
OL,9,FTrust highlighting the "scale and
OL,10,Fmassing" of the buildings.
